1
00:00:00,432 --> 00:00:02,702
(Raj:)Well, it's getting late.

2
00:00:02,701 --> 00:00:04,971
(Raj:)Maybe we should head home.

3
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:07,700
(Stuart:)Yeah, you're probably right.

4
00:00:09,174 --> 00:00:10,904
(Raj:)You coming?

5
00:00:10,909 --> 00:00:12,709
(Stuart:)Yeah, just give me a minute.

6
00:00:12,711 --> 00:00:13,941
(Raj:)Why?

7
00:00:13,946 --> 00:00:17,586
(Stuart:)Well, you know how
you're wearing a bathing suit?

8
00:00:17,583 --> 00:00:19,513
(Raj:)Yeah?

9
00:00:19,518 --> 00:00:22,588
(Stuart:)I kind of went the other way.

10
00:00:23,755 --> 00:00:26,325
(Howard:)You jackasses just bought
yourselves a hot tub!

11
00:00:38,972 --> 00:00:40,702
(Leonard:)What do you think?

12
00:00:40,707 --> 00:00:41,937
(Amy:)It's a nice enough spot.

13
00:00:41,942 --> 00:00:44,172
(Amy:)You know, if I'm going to start
standing up for myself,

14
00:00:44,177 --> 00:00:45,107
(Amy:)this is exactly
the kind of thing...

15
00:00:45,104 --> 00:00:45,874
We're back!

16
00:00:45,899 --> 00:00:47,519
Oh, hi! Hi!

17
00:00:49,683 --> 00:00:51,193
(Sheldon:)Hello.

18
00:00:51,189 --> 00:00:52,359
(Leonard:)How you guys doing?

19
00:00:52,357 --> 00:00:53,527
(Penny:)We're doing good. I think

20
00:00:53,525 --> 00:00:59,025
(Penny:)Sheldon has something he
would like to say to Amy.

